  "meaning": {
    "inSeason": "The VSGP table marks the month for this produce (Swiss season). The published table does not separate field-fresh, protected cultivation and storage months.",
    "storageAssumption": "For produce in `storageProduce`, marked months from November to March are reported as `storage` (stored Swiss harvest) rather than `fresh`. This is a documented planner assumption, not a VSGP distinction.",
    "notCovered": "Produce not in the VSGP table (fruit, cultivated mushrooms, imported produce) is reported as `uncertain`; no Swiss origin is claimed for it.",
    "minorProduce": "Aromatics and herbs never define a dish's seasonality; they can neither make a dish seasonal nor cancel an out-of-season defining ingredient.",
    "seasoningPepper": "`pepper` alone (black/white/ground pepper, peppercorns) is a seasoning and never matches the Peperoni row.",
    "labels": "`label` is the English cooking term shown in planner notes for the row."
  },
